# Titan of Industry, modes 2 and 4 with no creature to shield. Bot2 exiles Titan with Swords to Plowshares in response to its enters
# trigger (Bot1 gains 7 life), so as the trigger resolves Bot1 controls no creature: the shield counter goes nowhere (CR 608.2d) and the
# life mode still has Bot1 gain 5 (20 + 7 + 5), a player being a legal target of the second mode (own player accepted).

